```Event Log Cleared or Redirected via wevtutil | sigma: rules/windows/defense_impairment/proc_creation_wevtutil_log_tampering.yml```
`dac_windows_process_creation` Image="*\\wevtutil.exe" OR OriginalFileName="wevtutil.exe" CommandLine IN ("* cl *", "* clear-log *") OR (CommandLine IN ("* sl *", "* set-log *") CommandLine="* -lfn:*" OR CommandLine="* /lfn:*" OR CommandLine="* –lfn:*" OR CommandLine="* —lfn:*" OR CommandLine="* ―lfn:*" OR CommandLine="* -logfilename:*" OR CommandLine="* /logfilename:*" OR CommandLine="* –logfilename:*" OR CommandLine="* —logfilename:*" OR CommandLine="* ―logfilename:*" OR CommandLine="* -e:false*" OR CommandLine="* /e:false*" OR CommandLine="* –e:false*" OR CommandLine="* —e:false*" OR CommandLine="* ―e:false*" OR CommandLine="* -enabled:false*" OR CommandLine="* /enabled:false*" OR CommandLine="* –enabled:false*" OR CommandLine="* —enabled:false*" OR CommandLine="* ―enabled:false*")
